---
status: approved
intent: >
  Build the /learn section shell: the layout (site TopBar and Footer, docs
  reading column, no sidebar), the private server-only template that renders
  one copy record in its fixed order, and the /learn index page with its
  metadata and records. The six answer-page routes are built by their own
  plans, one per page folder, on top of this template.
---

## Project Structure

Additive inside an existing folder: `.aide`, `brief.aide` and the six page
folders' `.aide` files exist; everything else is NEW. No file under
`src/app/learn/` carries `'use client'` (brief #4). The six page folders are
child modules with their own specs and their own plans; their `page.tsx` files
are not built by this plan.

```
