## Prerequisites

- `src/data/learn/plan.aide` complete: `@/data/learn` default `learnRoster`; `@/data/learn/learnIndex` default `LearnIndexCopy`; `@/data/learn/templateLabels` default (`faqHeading`, `faqId`, `relatedHeading`, `relatedId`, `asOfPrefix`, `updatedLabel`).
- `src/app/_shared/listSitePages/plan.aide` complete: `@/app/_shared/listSitePages/findSitePage` default `findSitePage(urlPath): Promise<SitePage>`.
- Root plan `.aide/plan.aide` steps 9 and 10 complete: `@/components/JsonLd` default `JsonLd({ document }: { document: JsonLdDocument }): JSX.Element`; `@/app/_shared/buildPageMetadata` default `buildPageMetadata(page: SitePage, image?: PageImage): Metadata`.
- Root plan step 12 (Footer `learn` link) before this plan's step 3 verify, so the section is reachable from the footer when checked.
- Built (no work): `@/service/structuredData` default `buildStructuredData(input: StructuredDataInput): JsonLdDocument`; `@/data/siteIdentity` default (`name`); `@/lib/shiki` default `getHighlighter()` with the `aide-theme` theme; `@/components/CodeBlock` default `CodeBlock({ html, label, code })`; `@/app/_components/TopBar`, `@/app/_components/Footer`; `@/app/docs/_components/DocsTemplate/Breadcrumb` default `Breadcrumb({ segments })`.

